1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 14=

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,480
I said you couldn't leave.

16
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,760
You didn't believe me.

17
00:01:10,921 --> 00:01:12,881
(Sword Immortal Inn)

18
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:17,400
Since you're all here,

19
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:19,239
let's get this straight.

20
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:20,599
How do you plan

21
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:22,799
to settle this?

22
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,319
Settle what?

23
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,879
We don't know what you mean.

24
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,680
Excuses.

25
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,719
Nothing but excuses.

26
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:54,760
You little brats.

27
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:56,920
You dared target my spirit vein.

28
00:01:58,079 --> 00:02:00,120
At first, I thought

29
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,040
you only wanted

30
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:04,439
to absorb a little primal energy.

31
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:05,640
If that were all,

32
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,560
I would've let it slide.

33
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:08,520
But

34
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,879
look what happened.

35
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:13,280
You destroyed my spirit vein.

36
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,599
Destroyed it!

37
00:02:14,879 --> 00:02:16,439
You've got some nerve.

38
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,280
This... This...

39
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:19,719
It...

40
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,159
It wasn't us.

41
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,360
It was that...

42
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:22,879
It was...

43
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,159
The storage room.

44
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,919
That kid in the storage room.

45
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:26,719
Nonsense.

46
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,240
You think I need you to tell me?

47
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,919
Can't I see for myself?

48
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,680
That kid

49
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,000
is merely

50
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:37,080
a penniless rogue cultivator.

51
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,879
How could he alone

52
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,159
disrupt the formation
suppressing my spirit vein?

53
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,840
Could you do that?

54
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,680
Or you two?

55
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:45,680
Could any of you?

56
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,719
It's too late for excuses.

57
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,759
That kid

58
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,719
already fled.

59
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:52,719
So,

60
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:54,360
you'll have

61
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,159
to cover the losses.

62
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,000
One, two, three...

63
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,240
All five of you.

64
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,199
What?

65
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,240
He fled?

66
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:00,199
This...

67
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:01,719
This won't end peacefully.

68
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:02,599
What do we do?

69
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,719
Let's overpower him together,

70
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,680
then leave.

71
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:27,003
(Greater Perfection Realm, Stage 9)

72
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,080
Greater Perfection Realm, Stage 9.

73
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:30,360
A half-step Earth Immortal.

74
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,120
You little brats

75
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:38,000
dare fight on my turf?

76
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:40,000
Do you think I'm a pushover?

77
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,560
Without some real strength,

78
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,639
how could I

79
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,840
run an inn this close

80
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,120
to Sword Immortal Island?

81
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,479
You lot

82
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:50,759
call yourselves prodigies,

83
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:53,319
yet never think before acting.

84
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:53,840
Idiots.

85
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:58,240
Senior.

86
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,280
We're sorry.

87
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:02,000
It was an honest mistake.

88
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:03,879
This is all our fault.

89
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,719
How would you like to settle this?

90
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,599
Yes, Innkeeper.

91
00:04:09,039 --> 00:04:10,319
Let's talk this out.

92
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,159
Please,

93
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,280
name your terms.

94
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,840
My terms?

95
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,080
Just one.

96
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:16,160
Since...

97
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,920
Since you destroyed my spirit vein,

98
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:20,399
you'll compensate me in full.

99
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:21,959
How much?

100
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,000
Simple.

101
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:25,680
Each of you leaves
200,000 spirit crystals.

102
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,759
Then you may go.

103
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,920
What?

104
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:30,720
No need to shout.

105
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,519
What, too expensive?

106
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,439
No problem.

107
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:36,639
Send out your signals.

108
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:40,920
Have your backers come get you.

109
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,160
(If Father learns what I did,)

110
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,759
(he'll be so disappointed.)

111
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,079
I'll pay.

112
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:55,879
But

113
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,279
200,000 spirit crystals

114
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,120
is far too much.

115
00:04:58,519 --> 00:05:00,439
I can't get that much right away.

116
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:01,920
I...

117
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:03,439
I only have 60,000.

118
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,439
60,000?

119
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:07,399
All right.

120
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:09,680
Pay whatever you have now.

121
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,079
If it's not enough,

122
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:11,959
then trade

123
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,639
the weapons you carry,

124
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,879
your magic boxes,

125
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,439
and cultivation arts.

126
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,560
If those still aren't enough,

127
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,839
you can

128
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:27,839
sign a debt note.

129
00:05:27,893 --> 00:05:28,599
(Debt Bond)

130
00:05:28,599 --> 00:05:29,532
(Chen Qiushui, Tianxuan's Holy Maiden,
damaged Guiyun Inn's spirit vein.)

131
00:05:29,532 --> 00:05:30,359
(Owes Innkeeper Mo Chen
200,000 spirit crystals.)

132
00:05:30,379 --> 00:05:31,879
(Debtor: Jiang Cheng)

133
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,240
We're all done.

134
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,959
Can we go now?

135
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,399
Indeed.

136
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,720
The debt notes are signed.

137
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,160
But before you leave,

138
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:49,079
let me remind you of one thing.

139
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,560
All of you

140
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:54,279
are prodigies of your sects.

141
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:57,120
Don't even think of defaulting.

142
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,680
If you do,

143
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:00,839
I'll have no choice

144
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:04,120
but to collect from each sect.

145
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:07,839
Of course not.

146
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,040
Go on. Get out.

147
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,920
Of course I know

148
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,600
that destroying the spirit vein

149
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,800
had nothing to do with you.

150
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,279
But I had no choice.

151
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,680
That kid ran too fast.

152
00:06:42,959 --> 00:06:44,720
So I had to make you

153
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:46,120
take the blame.

154
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,560
Still,

155
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:53,439
that kid plays dirty.

156
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:57,279
I kindly cleared out a storage room

157
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,079
for you to rest,

158
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:58,959
and you had the nerve

159
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:01,360
to drain my entire spirit vein.

160
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,040
You little punk.

161
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,399
Don't let me see you again.

162
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,480
Or else,

163
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,319
I'll teach you a proper lesson.

164
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,519
One times two is two.

165
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,279
Two times two is four.

166
00:07:16,276 --> 00:07:19,601
(Sword Immortal Island Pier)

167
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,800
Holy Son.

168
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:27,480
The losses suffered today
by our two sects

169
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,959
should be charged to you.

170
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,600
What?

171
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,160
Why should I pay?

172
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,959
I paid spirit crystals too.

173
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:34,279
If it weren't for your terrible idea,

174
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,839
we wouldn't have lost so much.

175
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,040
200,000 spirit crystals.

176
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:38,800
That's enough to cover

177
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,240
every disciple's yearly expenses.

178
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:41,360
What?

179
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,879
Now you're being unreasonable?

180
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,519
You chose to follow me in.

181
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,680
You wanted profit.

182
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:46,720
Now that there's trouble,

183
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:48,000
you refuse to take responsibility?

184
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,160
As the young sect master,

185
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,959
I must set an example.

186
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,839
Now I owe 100,000 spirit crystals.

187
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,680
How can I ask my sect to pay?

188
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,160
I'll just consider myself unlucky.

189
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:01,800
See?

190
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,319
My Qiushui is reasonable.

191
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,879
Enough about this.

192
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,879
I'm upset too.

193
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:09,120
She doesn't speak for me.

194
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:09,720
Anyway,

195
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,319
you still have to cover my losses.

196
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:12,800
Mine too.

197
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,160
What?

198
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,319
You two

199
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,000
want to fight me?

200
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,160
Come on.

201
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,079
I'm not afraid.

202
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:20,639
You...

203
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:21,839
You're all so loud.

204
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,839
Can't you be quiet?

205
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,439
- Zhao Feiyang?
- Zhao Feiyang?

206
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:30,680
Zhao Feiyang.

207
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,080
Why weren't you at the inn?

208
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,159
Where did you go?

209
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,679
I couldn't sleep there.

210
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,679
So I rose early.

211
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,279
Is that a problem?

212
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:40,000
Did you destroy the spirit vein?

213
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,000
What spirit vein?

214
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:43,879
The inn's spirit vein.

215
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,399
It was suddenly destroyed,

216
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,559
and you suddenly vanished.

217
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:47,600
Tell me.

218
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:48,720
Was it you?

219
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,159
You mean that spirit vein?

220
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,320
Yes, I did it.

221
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:55,879
It really was you.

222
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,759
You all heard him.

223
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,559
This mess

224
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:00,000
was pinned on us because of him.

225
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,919
He should pay us back.

226
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:02,799
Enough.

227
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:04,679
How could he alone

228
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,879
destroy a high-grade spirit vein?

229
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,440
I'm not defending him.

230
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,720
With his strength,

231
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,840
he truly couldn't do it.

232
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,799
Jiang Cheng.

233
00:09:11,039 --> 00:09:12,080
Stop shifting the blame.

234
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:14,919
You...

235
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,159
Fine.

236
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,519
All right.

237
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,600
So that's how it is?

238
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,320
Fine.

239
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:22,279
I'll pay each of you
another 30,000 spirit crystals.

240
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:23,279
Will that do?

241
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:23,799
I...

242
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:24,720
That's it.

243
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:25,639
Not a crystal more.

244
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,840
Push me, and I won't pay anything.

245
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:31,440
Zhao Feiyang, why are you here?

246
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,159
To reach the island, of course.

247
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,720
You?

248
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,559
Do you think

249
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:42,600
just anyone can go there?

250
00:09:42,919 --> 00:09:45,559
You need a recommendation letter
from royalty or a sect to enter.

251
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:46,799
He has no recommendation letter.

252
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:47,960
He can't go.

253
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:52,240
The boat is here.

254
00:10:00,070 --> 00:10:02,730
(Girl in Red, Sword Immortal Island)

255
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,759
We can enter the island.

256
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,639
I'll board first.

257
00:10:08,919 --> 00:10:09,519
Young lady.

258
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,639
I'm Jiang Cheng,
Holy Son of Nanyuan Kingdom.

259
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,840
(Nanyuan)
My recommendation letter.

260
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,639
Please let me board first.

261
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,720
I'm Cuihua, the Young Sect Master
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

262
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,799
My recommendation letter.

263
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:19,159
I'm the Holy Maiden
of Tianxuan Kingdom.

264
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,399
(Tianxuan)
My recommendation letter.

265
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,639
(Qingyun Sect)
Qin Lan, Qingyun Sect's chief disciple.

266
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:25,080
(Wu)
Liang Wu, Tianwu Sect's chief disciple.

267
00:10:26,401 --> 00:10:27,028
Oh.

268
00:10:27,448 --> 00:10:28,141
Oh?

269
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,480
What does "oh" mean?

270
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:34,200
It means "oh".

271
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,240
Did I say you could board?

272
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,039
Holy Son of Nanyuan Kingdom,

273
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,399
you really don't know the rules.

274
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,240
What do you mean?

275
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:49,679
Aren't you here to pick us up?

276
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:51,440
Yes.

277
00:10:51,559 --> 00:10:52,320
Then what?

278
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,080
That's more like it.

279
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,600
Now you know the rules.

280
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:15,919
Board.

281
00:11:16,399 --> 00:11:16,879
Thank you.

282
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:25,559
Anyone else boarding?

283
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,919
If not, we're leaving.

284
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,720
She's asking us for money.

285
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:30,360
Darn.

286
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,519
We're out of money.

287
00:11:32,039 --> 00:11:33,200
Can't you make an exception?

288
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,039
Please make an exception, miss.

289
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,919
We'll repay you handsomely later.

290
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,720
We're off.

291
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:39,960
Young lady.

292
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:41,200
This man has no status.

293
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,120
He's just a loser.

294
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,840
Even if he paid you,

295
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:45,000
he can't enter the island.

296
00:11:46,919 --> 00:11:48,279
What's that got to do with me?

297
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:48,919
You...

298
00:11:50,039 --> 00:11:50,879
What do we do now?

299
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,000
Right.

300
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,399
I happen to have

301
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,279
some spare spirit crystals.

302
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:57,159
If any of you need it,

303
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,639
you need only ask nicely.

304
00:11:59,159 --> 00:11:59,559
You...

305
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:00,360
Fine, forget it.

306
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:01,840
I never said no.

307
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,720
There are plenty of trees.

308
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,840
Cut them down and build a raft.

309
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,000
Do you know who we are?

310
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,519
How dare you make us chop wood?

311
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,559
The island is 500 kilometers away.

312
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:13,200
We...

313
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:14,879
You...

314
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:19,440
We're leaving.

315
00:12:26,279 --> 00:12:26,879
Qiushui.

316
00:12:27,159 --> 00:12:27,799
Look at him.

317
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,720
Look at his smug face.

318
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,679
Just you wait.

319
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,159
Why stoop to a nobody's level?

320
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,120
What's the point?

321
00:12:34,799 --> 00:12:36,720
We need to reach the island first.

322
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,320
Let's go cut trees.

323
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,320
Zhao Feiyang.

324
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:46,399
Just you wait.

325
00:12:46,559 --> 00:12:47,519
I'll kill you.

326
00:12:57,170 --> 00:13:00,263
(Sword Immortal Island)

327
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:03,559
Miss.

328
00:13:04,159 --> 00:13:05,639
You didn't even ask who I am,

329
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:07,639
yet you brought me here.

330
00:13:09,759 --> 00:13:12,840
Would you dare cause trouble here?

331
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:15,639
Fair point.

332
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:18,440
All right, enough teasing.

333
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,720
Greetings, Honglian Sword Immortal.

334
00:13:29,922 --> 00:13:33,552
♪I once stood on high, drawing
spiritual energy into my blade♪

335
00:13:33,709 --> 00:13:36,379
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

336
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:40,189
♪Then came my fall, with frost
and snow on my shoulders♪

337
00:13:40,369 --> 00:13:44,569
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

338
00:13:45,019 --> 00:13:48,269
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

339
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:51,449
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

340
00:13:51,759 --> 00:13:55,139
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

341
00:13:55,269 --> 00:13:59,499
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

342
00:13:59,939 --> 00:14:03,069
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

343
00:14:03,359 --> 00:14:06,439
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

344
00:14:07,009 --> 00:14:09,849
♪With this flesh and soul♪

345
00:14:10,079 --> 00:14:13,099
♪I shall forge a new age♪

346
00:14:13,436 --> 00:14:16,506
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

347
00:14:16,756 --> 00:14:19,846
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

348
00:14:20,066 --> 00:14:22,296
♪At cultivation's peak♪

349
00:14:22,436 --> 00:14:26,276
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

350
00:14:26,686 --> 00:14:29,306
♪The sun and moon turn♪

351
00:14:29,326 --> 00:14:32,996
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

352
00:14:33,456 --> 00:14:40,236
♪I am the undying flame♪

353
00:14:40,916 --> 00:14:45,636
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

354
00:14:45,986 --> 00:14:49,166
♪At last I see, immortality♪

355
00:14:49,326 --> 00:14:53,966
♪Lives in your smiles♪
